Date: Spring &ndash; 2026
---

Every entity escapeLatexText writes as its character (PROSE_ENTITIES,
src/latex-escape.js), in a heading, a note, a caption and the title, and one
to an item below, each between brackets. latex-document checks that the list
names each of them; latex-compile compiles it with pdfLaTeX, LuaLaTeX and
fontspec, and as a fragment in a plain (OT1) document, and reads the PDF.

